  sysid action, 5.0 kW -> None
  sysid action, 1.5 kW -> None
  sysid action, 0.0 kW -> None
  null control: no action, plan step 5.0 kW -> see step_duty below

## pump_arbiter.step_duty (pump_arbiter.py:325): the same level a plan steps
  plan power_schedule=[5.0] -> 'space'
  plan power_schedule=[1.5] -> 'space'
  plan power_schedule=[0.0] -> 'idle'

## _planned_duty on a plan step needs the boost ledger; the control above is
   step_duty, the function _planned_duty delegates to (pump_arbiter.py:749).

